(7753615, 1281914, 30049, '<td valign="top">Why all of the poles against the wall?  That''s a story I''d like to hear about.</td>', 'Why all of the poles against the wall?  That''s a story I''d like to hear about.', '2023-07-09 21:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
