(7753624, 1281980, 30049, '<td valign="top">Perfect spot / location to grab this image.  Really jumps out.  I like the overall processing choices and the color tone.  Looks like some bleed over into the tree in the upper-right that feels like a gradient was applied?  Still, my top pick for this challenge.</td>', 'Perfect spot / location to grab this image.  Really jumps out.  I like the overall processing choices and the color tone.  Looks like some bleed over into the tree in the upper-right that feels like a gradient was applied?  Still, my top pick for this challenge.', '2023-07-09 21:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
