(7753630, 1281493, 138630, '<td valign="top">The selective focus is just right and works so well here - it''s not only not distracting, it actually contributes to the story.  And those eyes!  A favorite.  Bump.  9.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'The selective focus is just right and works so well here - it''s not only not distracting, it actually contributes to the story.  And those eyes!  A favorite.  Bump.  9.  Voted earlier.', '2023-07-10 00:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
