(7753737, 1281940, 75585, '<td valign="top">My apologies on the wrong photographer!  Live and learn - I hardly ever guess but my apologies that I did and got it wrong.  Nonetheless a great image.  I grew up going to the Peter Iredale.  One of my favorite places.  ETA: I agree with Zoomdak this wreck sure ebbs and flows on how much is visible, this looks more like it did back in the 80s than in the early 2000s to me, last time I was there it seemed so buried like it was just being swallowed up.  Kind of happy that it isnt - this is gorgeous<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2023-07-10 19:39:27.</i></td>', 'My apologies on the wrong photographer!  Live and learn - I hardly ever guess but my apologies that I did and got it wrong.  Nonetheless a great image.  I grew up going to the Peter Iredale.  One of my favorite places.  ETA: I agree with Zoomdak this wreck sure ebbs and flows on how much is visible, this looks more like it did back in the 80s than in the early 2000s to me, last time I was there it seemed so buried like it was just being swallowed up.  Kind of happy that it isnt - this is gorgeous', '2023-07-10 19:05:36.000000', '2023-07-10 20:39:27.000000', 0),
(7753738, 1282017, 75585, '<td valign="top">How funny that your abandoned boat and Nams finished back to back! Great find and lovely colors, I too would have loved more contrast in the sky.</td>', 'How funny that your abandoned boat and Nams finished back to back! Great find and lovely colors, I too would have loved more contrast in the sky.', '2023-07-10 19:06:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(7753748, 1281996, 67145, '<td valign="top">my absolute favourite in the challenge .. not just because its a different take but because its such an emotive image .. perfect bnw edit as well .. :)<br/> <br/>i met a man and his dog at the dog park one day and he told me the story of how his dog had been dropped off at a local shelter in the middle of the night and left there .. they knew what had happened because of the cct footage .. how can anyone drop their dog off and drive away .. its beyond comprehension .. <br/>anyway the man adopted the dog and was saying how the dog was the best dog he''d ever had . such a beautiful temperament .. and so wonderful for his family .. got on with everyone .. and other dogs .. <br/>anyway .. seeing this pic brings back that story that had a very happy ending .. not all dogs get that .. :(</td>', 'my absolute favourite in the challenge .. not just because its a different take but because its such an emotive image .. perfect bnw edit as well .. :) i met a man and his dog at the dog park one day and he told me the story of how his dog had been dropped off at a local shelter in the middle of the night and left there .. they knew what had happened because of the cct footage .. how can anyone drop their dog off and drive away .. its beyond comprehension .. anyway the man adopted the dog and was saying how the dog was the best dog he''d ever had . such a beautiful temperament .. and so wonderful for his family .. got on with everyone .. and other dogs .. anyway .. seeing this pic brings back that story that had a very happy ending .. not all dogs get that .. :(', '2023-07-10 21:49:10.000000', NULL, 0),
